WEBVTT

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:09.426
A NETFLIX ORIGINAL ANIME SERIES

00:00:12.637 --> 00:00:15.807
ORIGINAL WORK BY KOUSUKE OONO

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:19.811
PRODUCED BY NETFLIX

00:01:42.018 --> 00:01:43.937
EPISODE 31

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:44.854
SIZZLE

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:46.439
Hi there!

00:01:47.023 --> 00:01:49.943
Would you like to try
our cured wiener sausages?

00:01:50.527 --> 00:01:53.947
These juicy wieners have been
carefully cured for 72 hours.

00:01:55.156 --> 00:01:56.407
Whoa, look at that stare.

00:01:56.491 --> 00:01:57.408
Tacchan!

00:01:57.492 --> 00:01:58.368
RUNNING

00:01:59.202 --> 00:02:00.620
Something serious has happened!

00:02:00.703 --> 00:02:01.579
What is it?

00:02:02.205 --> 00:02:03.915
Hey, what about my shopping?

00:02:03.998 --> 00:02:05.208
Quickly!

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:06.960
Look!

00:02:07.043 --> 00:02:08.336
It's Po…

00:02:08.419 --> 00:02:10.588
Policure!

00:02:10.672 --> 00:02:11.506
BAM

00:02:12.882 --> 00:02:14.759
Hey, they're getting a beating.

00:02:15.343 --> 00:02:17.303
Come on, Policure! You can do it!

00:02:17.387 --> 00:02:18.513
Come on!

00:02:18.596 --> 00:02:21.516
Policure!
Keep your distance and kick more!

00:02:21.599 --> 00:02:23.768
Everyone, the Policure are in trouble!

00:02:24.352 --> 00:02:26.980
Is there anyone here who can help them?

00:02:27.063 --> 00:02:30.942
The kid who helps out can have
a photo taken with them afterwards!

00:02:31.526 --> 00:02:33.653
What? No way. I want it.

00:02:33.736 --> 00:02:37.157
But there's no way
I can get on that stage… Dammit!

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:38.867
You want it that bad?

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:42.871
Right then, everyone!
Raise your hands if--

00:02:45.456 --> 00:02:46.374
What?

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:48.626
<i>I have to choose him…</i>

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:49.544
Okay…

00:02:50.128 --> 00:02:51.129
<i>…or he'll kill me!</i>

00:02:51.796 --> 00:02:52.839
You over there…

00:02:56.634 --> 00:02:59.178
Nice to make your acquaintance.

00:02:59.262 --> 00:03:02.557
You've got some nerve,
taking Boss Renkon from us!

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:04.142
Today, you're going to pay for that!

00:03:04.225 --> 00:03:05.935
Oh, please!

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:08.980
What about all the people
who have suffered at your hands?

00:03:09.063 --> 00:03:10.106
Be quiet!

00:03:10.189 --> 00:03:12.150
Boss is still locked up
eating prison food--

00:03:12.233 --> 00:03:13.192
Settle down!

00:03:13.276 --> 00:03:14.402
Oh, sure.

00:03:15.194 --> 00:03:18.239
Which of you started this fight?

00:03:18.323 --> 00:03:22.744
Well… It's hard to tell who exactly…

00:03:23.328 --> 00:03:25.914
Gokudon builds up
the evil in people's hearts…

00:03:25.997 --> 00:03:28.082
…and takes in all their negative energy!

00:03:28.166 --> 00:03:32.003
In this world, you're either
getting beaten or doing the beating.

00:03:32.086 --> 00:03:34.005
Conflict breeds more conflict.

00:03:34.589 --> 00:03:36.758
Violence won't protect anything.

00:03:37.383 --> 00:03:38.468
Miku! Get the stuff!

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:39.427
RUSTLE

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:40.428
FWIP

00:03:40.511 --> 00:03:41.512
CLACK

00:03:42.096 --> 00:03:42.931
POP

00:03:43.014 --> 00:03:44.182
POUR

00:03:44.265 --> 00:03:46.601
Thank you for your patience!

00:03:46.684 --> 00:03:49.520
I would like to extend
my deepest gratitude to all of you!

00:03:50.104 --> 00:03:52.232
Policure Group, Gokudon Group,

00:03:52.315 --> 00:03:57.111
we will now perform the ceremonial
drinking rites of reconciliation!

00:03:57.195 --> 00:03:58.321
SPLASH

00:03:58.404 --> 00:03:59.239
SPILL

00:04:00.365 --> 00:04:01.699
CLAP…

00:04:02.325 --> 00:04:04.953
CLAP…

00:04:05.578 --> 00:04:08.623
And now, Policure Group, Gokudon Group,

00:04:08.706 --> 00:04:12.543
let us pray for the future prosperity
of both your houses…

00:04:14.379 --> 00:04:15.505
CLAP

00:04:16.089 --> 00:04:17.465
Right.

00:04:17.548 --> 00:04:18.716
Well…

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:21.344
It is now time for
the meet and greet event.

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:24.347
Wow, you're so cute!

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:26.474
SCARED THE HELL OUT OF ME

00:04:26.557 --> 00:04:27.976
<i>-The Way of the Househusband.
-The Way of the Househusband.</i>

00:04:29.435 --> 00:04:30.603
EPISODE 32

00:04:30.687 --> 00:04:31.938
This way.

00:04:32.772 --> 00:04:34.774
So this is the stuff…

00:04:35.483 --> 00:04:39.487
Someone I know gave it to me,
but I dunno what to do with it.

00:04:40.071 --> 00:04:43.491
Hey, this has a steam function.

00:04:44.075 --> 00:04:46.494
And the temperature
goes all the way up to 300 degrees

00:04:46.577 --> 00:04:48.454
with a capacity of 30 liters…

00:04:49.163 --> 00:04:51.958
This is really gonna expand
the possibilities of my cooking!

00:04:52.041 --> 00:04:54.168
What will you use it for?

00:04:54.252 --> 00:04:55.503
CLANG, CLICK

00:04:58.089 --> 00:05:00.008
Boss, don't tell me that's…

00:05:00.591 --> 00:05:03.136
Bread flour and dry yeast!

00:05:03.803 --> 00:05:07.181
<i>There he goes again
with his white powders.</i>

00:05:07.265 --> 00:05:10.435
Bash it up a bit and you get bread!

00:05:10.518 --> 00:05:12.937
The mix and temperature are important.

00:05:13.021 --> 00:05:16.733
One gram of salt and yeast either way,
and you're a goner!

00:05:16.816 --> 00:05:18.735
STICK

00:05:18.818 --> 00:05:19.652
SLAP

00:05:19.736 --> 00:05:21.237
Gluten is formed!

00:05:21.321 --> 00:05:24.240
Bash it up and drag it around
from its torso!

00:05:24.824 --> 00:05:27.827
That, my friend, is the greatest secret
in making it fluffy and moist!

00:05:28.411 --> 00:05:30.288
Fluffy and moist?

00:05:30.371 --> 00:05:32.999
Right, now we wrap it up and let it rise.

00:05:33.082 --> 00:05:34.542
Okay, I'll get the plastic wrap.

00:05:35.418 --> 00:05:37.462
Let's see… plastic wrap…

00:05:37.545 --> 00:05:39.464
My leg's caught on something.

00:05:39.547 --> 00:05:40.381
THUD

00:05:40.923 --> 00:05:43.051
Shit, the oven!

00:05:43.134 --> 00:05:44.469
CLICK

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:47.013
SILENCE

00:05:47.096 --> 00:05:50.016
No, microwave oven!

00:05:50.099 --> 00:05:51.225
SET

00:05:51.309 --> 00:05:52.143
SHUT

00:05:53.269 --> 00:05:54.604
I'm really sorry, Boss!

00:05:54.687 --> 00:05:56.272
I'll enact
the proper punishment on myself!

00:05:56.939 --> 00:05:58.816
Just need to guugle
the right method first…

00:05:58.900 --> 00:05:59.734
SMACK

00:06:00.318 --> 00:06:01.819
I have a good method.

00:06:01.903 --> 00:06:02.737
CREAK

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:03.654
CLICK

00:06:03.738 --> 00:06:05.198
A… rice cooker?

00:06:05.782 --> 00:06:09.994
You have to ferment the dough
at around 30 degrees.

00:06:10.495 --> 00:06:14.373
Honestly, it's difficult
getting the temperature just right,

00:06:14.457 --> 00:06:17.126
but with the "keep warm" mode
on the rice cooker,

00:06:18.294 --> 00:06:20.171
it's actually doable!

00:06:20.755 --> 00:06:21.714
Do ten minutes in the keep warm mode!

00:06:22.381 --> 00:06:24.133
Then turn it off and wait 40 minutes!

00:06:24.717 --> 00:06:28.012
Now let it rest!
Punch out the air and reshape.

00:06:28.096 --> 00:06:29.347
Then ferment it again!

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:32.809
Finally, brush oil on top
and bake in rice cooking mode!

00:06:32.892 --> 00:06:33.726
CLICK

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:37.021
We're in luck!

00:06:37.105 --> 00:06:39.232
It's nice and fluffy!

00:06:39.315 --> 00:06:42.735
-Boss has got the skills!
-Finish it off with this bad boy!

00:06:42.819 --> 00:06:44.362
Draw in some eyes.

00:06:44.445 --> 00:06:46.531
Your character-themed bread is done!

00:06:46.614 --> 00:06:47.990
It's so cute!

00:06:48.574 --> 00:06:49.450
Here.

00:06:49.534 --> 00:06:50.785
It's too hot!

00:06:55.873 --> 00:06:58.292
EPISODE 33

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:00.753
Huh? What's that?

00:07:01.462 --> 00:07:02.463
It's from next door!

00:07:02.547 --> 00:07:03.548
BANG

00:07:04.132 --> 00:07:05.007
Is it a fire?

00:07:07.051 --> 00:07:08.511
What are you playing at?

00:07:11.722 --> 00:07:13.391
I'm having a barbecue.

00:07:13.474 --> 00:07:14.392
TURN

00:07:14.475 --> 00:07:16.727
Oh, would you like some meat?

00:07:17.687 --> 00:07:19.188
Meat, you say?

00:07:30.199 --> 00:07:32.827
GRAB, SIZZLE

00:07:36.164 --> 00:07:38.749
My sincere apologies, Tatsu.

00:07:39.333 --> 00:07:42.253
What are you trying to do, Bob?
I almost died there.

00:07:42.837 --> 00:07:45.590
I moved here because I love Japan,

00:07:45.673 --> 00:07:48.259
but I suddenly really missed
the food back home.

00:07:48.843 --> 00:07:51.762
But I can't barbecue like my daddy.

00:07:51.846 --> 00:07:54.599
Hey, step outside.

00:07:54.682 --> 00:07:55.600
What?

00:08:00.396 --> 00:08:01.439
The goods?

00:08:02.023 --> 00:08:04.442
I fully stocked up at Dostco.

00:08:04.525 --> 00:08:05.359
VALUE PACK

00:08:05.443 --> 00:08:06.569
That's the stuff.

00:08:07.695 --> 00:08:11.032
I'll bust out the real shit for you.

00:08:11.866 --> 00:08:14.202
Cut off the fat
once the meat's at room temperature.

00:08:14.285 --> 00:08:15.745
Whoa, blade skills!

00:08:16.579 --> 00:08:17.955
Salt and pepper!

00:08:18.581 --> 00:08:21.209
Then quickly sear it
when your grill is hot!

00:08:21.292 --> 00:08:22.126
Yes!

00:08:22.752 --> 00:08:24.837
Once the side has browned, turn it over!

00:08:25.338 --> 00:08:29.342
Lastly, wrap the meat in foil
and leave it to rest in its own heat!

00:08:29.425 --> 00:08:30.426
Yes!

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:32.053
This will make sure it's rare and juicy--

00:08:32.136 --> 00:08:33.638
Hey, stop right there!

00:08:34.263 --> 00:08:35.473
What are you doing?

00:08:35.556 --> 00:08:37.058
Why are you barbecuing here?

00:08:37.141 --> 00:08:38.017
Hey!

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:40.144
I'll deal with them!

00:08:40.228 --> 00:08:41.521
Stop this behavior!

00:08:41.604 --> 00:08:42.772
Get rid of the meat!

00:08:42.855 --> 00:08:45.316
You're obstructing a police officer!

00:08:45.399 --> 00:08:46.234
Bob!

00:08:47.276 --> 00:08:48.194
Tatsu!

00:08:51.906 --> 00:08:53.074
Tatsu!

00:08:54.367 --> 00:08:57.787
I can't eat rare meat!

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:02.792
SUSHI

00:09:02.875 --> 00:09:06.295
"Have a fun time with nature
at Bremen Farm"?

00:09:06.379 --> 00:09:09.549
Someone at work gave it to me. Let's go!

00:09:09.632 --> 00:09:12.802
You still think
this is gonna be fun at our age?

00:09:13.386 --> 00:09:16.013
It'll be crowded on the weekend
and roads will be busy.

00:09:16.097 --> 00:09:16.931
And…

00:09:17.515 --> 00:09:18.724
We're here!

00:09:19.725 --> 00:09:22.144
Hey, look,
everyone is having a great time.

00:09:22.728 --> 00:09:24.397
Hi, excuse me.

00:09:25.022 --> 00:09:26.065
HAVE A FUN TIME WITH NATURE AT BREMEN FARM

00:09:26.649 --> 00:09:28.067
One more, please.

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:29.026
Okay!

00:09:29.652 --> 00:09:31.362
From below, looking up!

00:09:31.445 --> 00:09:32.321
Yes, sir!

00:09:32.989 --> 00:09:35.199
Look at you. You're having a great time.

00:09:35.283 --> 00:09:36.492
Not really.

00:09:37.243 --> 00:09:40.454
Listen, this is not any old farm.

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:45.835
There are so many events here
catering for everyone.

00:09:45.918 --> 00:09:48.796
Seasonal flowers, gourmet ateliers,
rides, craft experiences…

00:09:48.879 --> 00:09:50.298
We should draw up a map…

00:09:50.381 --> 00:09:52.258
Look! It's a petting zoo!

00:09:57.513 --> 00:09:58.514
Where are you going?

00:10:02.059 --> 00:10:05.521
Once these skins are filled,
we'll give 'em a good flaming.

00:10:06.022 --> 00:10:10.151
I hear your shit here is 100% natural.
Am I correct?

00:10:10.818 --> 00:10:12.820
Jump on after me!

00:10:13.696 --> 00:10:16.073
Phew, I'm starving!

00:10:16.657 --> 00:10:18.326
These places are always expensive.

00:10:18.909 --> 00:10:19.785
Nice, packed lunches?

00:10:20.369 --> 00:10:21.787
Well, more like snacks.

00:10:22.371 --> 00:10:23.748
Wow, you really went for it!

00:10:24.332 --> 00:10:26.834
Looks like you're more up
for it today than I am!

00:10:26.917 --> 00:10:28.628
Not really.

00:10:28.711 --> 00:10:29.879
Yes, you are!

00:10:29.962 --> 00:10:31.297
No, I'm not.

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:33.049
-Yes, you are.
-No, I'm not.

00:10:33.132 --> 00:10:35.468
-Yes, you are--
-Okay, I am!

00:10:35.551 --> 00:10:38.304
I've been looking forward
to this for days!

00:10:39.096 --> 00:10:40.514
Oh, well…

00:10:41.265 --> 00:10:42.224
Sorry.

00:10:43.434 --> 00:10:45.978
Living underground and all,

00:10:46.062 --> 00:10:49.857
I never had the chance as a kid
to come to a theme park like this.

00:10:50.483 --> 00:10:52.485
I've always longed to come.

00:10:52.568 --> 00:10:53.694
Oh, that's sweet.

00:10:54.528 --> 00:10:58.908
So thank you, Miku.
It's been a day to remember.

00:10:59.492 --> 00:11:00.868
What are you on about?

00:11:00.951 --> 00:11:05.373
We still have the seasonal food tastings,
the big sheep parade, and horse riding!

00:11:05.456 --> 00:11:07.750
There's a lot more stuff to do
in the second half!

00:11:10.002 --> 00:11:10.920
Rain…

00:11:14.799 --> 00:11:16.634
The rain will pass soon.

00:11:42.243 --> 00:11:43.744
<i>-The Way of the Househusband.
-The Way of the Househusband.</i>

00:11:45.955 --> 00:11:48.958
EPISODE 35

00:11:49.041 --> 00:11:50.084
I can't see.

00:11:50.167 --> 00:11:52.461
Damn, where is it?

00:11:53.003 --> 00:11:54.171
Over here!

00:11:55.005 --> 00:11:57.466
-Don't think I won't get you!
-I said it's over here!

00:11:57.550 --> 00:11:58.467
Jeez.

00:11:59.051 --> 00:12:00.678
Bet you were scared, weren't ya?

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:03.639
Wow.

00:12:04.265 --> 00:12:05.933
I sure love the sea.

00:12:06.016 --> 00:12:08.519
-Are you gonna take off that lifesaver?
-No, dear.

00:12:08.602 --> 00:12:12.148
I'll need it for snorkeling,
fishing, crab picking, diving,

00:12:12.231 --> 00:12:13.441
and banana boat rides.

00:12:13.524 --> 00:12:15.109
So many pictures here of stuff to do--

00:12:16.235 --> 00:12:17.069
THWACK

00:12:17.153 --> 00:12:18.112
Tacchan!

00:12:18.779 --> 00:12:21.115
Oh, I'm so sorry!

00:12:21.907 --> 00:12:25.453
We were just playing
beach volleyball over there…

00:12:25.536 --> 00:12:26.787
It's The Bears.

00:12:27.413 --> 00:12:28.873
Oh, it's you!

00:12:28.956 --> 00:12:29.790
Do you know him?

00:12:29.874 --> 00:12:32.501
A group of mothers and I
played against them once.

00:12:33.085 --> 00:12:36.172
That's right. I seem to remember we won.

00:12:37.423 --> 00:12:38.799
Oh, yeah.

00:12:39.550 --> 00:12:41.135
Okay, then.

00:12:41.218 --> 00:12:43.971
If you wanna have a rematch,
let us know anytime.

00:12:45.097 --> 00:12:45.931
Sure thing.

00:12:46.015 --> 00:12:47.141
You idiot!

00:12:47.224 --> 00:12:48.976
Are you okay with them
walking all over you?

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:51.187
-Aren't you a man?
-Yes, ma'am.

00:12:51.812 --> 00:12:53.230
Get up! Stand up!

00:12:53.314 --> 00:12:54.148
Yes, ma'am!

00:12:55.107 --> 00:12:56.901
-Hey, you're on!
-Huh?

00:12:58.235 --> 00:12:59.111
Let's play!

00:13:01.655 --> 00:13:04.408
Three sets! The first to win two sets
wins the match!

00:13:04.492 --> 00:13:05.367
Miku!

00:13:05.993 --> 00:13:06.869
Star Cyclone!

00:13:06.952 --> 00:13:08.621
Plasma Buster!

00:13:08.704 --> 00:13:10.873
Starlight Illusion!

00:13:11.499 --> 00:13:12.416
I'm so tired!

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:13.918
Yeah, it's all the shouting.

00:13:14.001 --> 00:13:15.002
What are you talking about?

00:13:15.586 --> 00:13:18.464
In sports, it's all about
using your voice! C'mon, do it!

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:21.342
Cyclonic Vacuum Cleaner!

00:13:21.425 --> 00:13:24.512
Plasma Blaster Air Purifier!

00:13:24.595 --> 00:13:27.473
LED Ceiling Lights!

00:13:27.556 --> 00:13:28.682
THE BEARS

00:13:29.308 --> 00:13:31.018
Oh, crap! That's the…

00:13:31.936 --> 00:13:33.771
Honor-and-Humanity Spike!

00:13:34.563 --> 00:13:35.940
BLAM

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:39.109
<i>I'm a man,</i>

00:13:39.193 --> 00:13:42.696
<i>so if I have to die protecting my wife,
I'm good with that.</i>

00:13:43.656 --> 00:13:44.490
The ball!

00:13:47.535 --> 00:13:49.328
-Tacchan, get up!
-Eh?

00:13:52.957 --> 00:13:53.832
BAM

00:13:53.916 --> 00:13:55.751
Male Honor Spike!

00:13:59.338 --> 00:14:00.214
CATCH

00:14:03.551 --> 00:14:06.679
See that? That's the power of a couple!

00:14:07.555 --> 00:14:09.390
He's getting carried like a princess.

00:14:14.979 --> 00:14:16.605
<i>Third-year Tatsu class!</i>

00:14:16.689 --> 00:14:18.899
<i>-Teacher Househusband!
-Teacher Househusband!</i>

00:14:19.483 --> 00:14:22.069
Hey, I heard that
a new teacher is coming today.

00:14:22.152 --> 00:14:22.987
Oh, yeah?

00:14:23.070 --> 00:14:25.239
Hmph, shall I give him hell?

00:14:25.322 --> 00:14:27.199
Hey, give it a rest.

00:14:27.283 --> 00:14:28.158
SLAM

00:14:32.955 --> 00:14:33.789
SMIRK

00:14:35.082 --> 00:14:38.294
Brothers and sisters,
please allow me to introduce myself.

00:14:38.377 --> 00:14:40.754
Thanks to some connections,

00:14:40.838 --> 00:14:44.008
I've been put in charge of
the third-year Tatsu class!

00:14:44.091 --> 00:14:48.095
I will put my life
on the line to serve you!

00:14:48.178 --> 00:14:49.763
My name is Tatsu!

00:14:49.847 --> 00:14:53.475
Although I have
a lot to learn in this trade,

00:14:53.559 --> 00:14:55.102
I will teach home economics!

00:14:55.895 --> 00:14:58.314
Hope we can work well together.

00:14:58.981 --> 00:15:00.357
Okay.

00:15:00.858 --> 00:15:02.610
SLIDE, MURMUR

00:15:02.693 --> 00:15:06.071
Now I will get you all
to do some dirty work.

00:15:06.155 --> 00:15:09.783
There are no rules.
Draw a picture of anything you want.

00:15:09.867 --> 00:15:10.993
This is…

00:15:11.619 --> 00:15:14.246
-A plain apron…
-And stencil sheets!

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:16.749
So we'll make a stencil
of an image we like

00:15:16.832 --> 00:15:18.667
and put it on the apron.

00:15:19.376 --> 00:15:20.878
That is correct.

00:15:22.296 --> 00:15:24.924
You want us to draw a picture on an apron?

00:15:25.716 --> 00:15:27.384
Give me a break!

00:15:29.845 --> 00:15:31.597
Are you scared?

00:15:32.181 --> 00:15:35.935
Everyone will have
an image of their choice on their aprons,

00:15:36.018 --> 00:15:38.771
while you'll just have a plain one.

00:15:38.854 --> 00:15:40.230
Goddammit!

00:15:41.023 --> 00:15:42.775
I'll do it then!

00:15:43.275 --> 00:15:44.401
Begin!

00:15:44.485 --> 00:15:45.861
STAB

00:15:45.945 --> 00:15:47.321
SNORE

00:15:47.404 --> 00:15:48.322
SLASH

00:15:49.114 --> 00:15:49.990
PAT

00:15:50.783 --> 00:15:53.452
Looks like everyone is all set.

00:15:54.703 --> 00:15:57.957
All right, let's go! Time to get cookin'!
